### Update Account
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sabah",
  "email": "sabah@examples.com",
  "mobileNumber": "1234567890",
  "accountsDTO": {
    "accountNumber": 1669256445,
    "accountType": "Savings",
    "branchAddress": "123 Main Street, New York"
  }
}
